{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天文台預期本周四，國慶日仍然酷熱，下周天氣轉涼。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-0800.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026S90gvUGoiz1790638236.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.HKO-0800.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天文台在網誌表示，高空反氣旋仍覆蓋著中國東南沿岸，區內日間陽光充沛。但隨著它減弱，以及一股東北季候風逐漸影響華南，國慶日較後時間及周末有幾陣驟雨，酷熱天氣告一段落。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-0800_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20269aNMmck6SQ1790638233.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.HKO-0800_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天文台預料一股東北季候風補充，會在下周初抵達廣東，本港的溫度在未來一周將會略為下降，屆時可感受到一點秋意。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T23:58:28.455799+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}